# Orthogonal alternatives in original 15.1.28

The six-dimensional natural module and its seven-dimensional cover are
excluded on the literal component action, including the possible
symmetric-eight extension. The six-space uses the original seed-stabilizer
core and the complete offender calculation in the four-block model.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith 15.1.27(1)--28, printed pp.1102--1103.
-/
